# ⭐ Pattern Programs

## Pattern 1

```text
*
**
***
****
*****
```

```go
package main

import "fmt"

func main() {
    for i := 1; i <= 5; i++ {
        for j := 1; j <= i; j++ {
            fmt.Print("*")
        }
        fmt.Println()
    }
}
```

---

## Pattern 2

```text
1
12
123
1234
12345
```

```go
package main

import "fmt"

func main() {
    for i := 1; i <= 5; i++ {
        for j := 1; j <= i; j++ {
            fmt.Print(j)
        }
        fmt.Println()
    }
}
```

