# 📊 Types of Loops in Go

| Loop Type     | Purpose              |
| ------------- | -------------------- |
| for           | Basic Loop           |
| While Style   | Condition-based Loop |
| Infinite Loop | Runs forever         |
| Nested Loop   | Loop inside Loop     |

